460 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 60 0 R
/T (The Heart Disease Prediction System was successfully developed and deployed. Logistic Regression gave the best cross-validation ROC-AUC \(0.8365\) and, after tuning \(C=10\), achieved a test accuracy of 80.0%, F1 score of 0.74 and ROC-AUC of 0.853. Thalach \(maximum heart rate\), oldpeak and exang were the most influential features. The trained model was served through a Flask REST API that correctly classified a high-risk and a low-risk patient and rejected incomplete input with status code 400. Note: this run used a simulated dataset with the UCI attributes, so the numbers will differ on the real dataset.)
/E (The Heart Disease Prediction System was successfully developed and deployed. Logistic Regression gave the best cross-validation ROC-AUC \(0.8365\) and, after tuning \(C=10\), achieved a test accuracy of 80.0%, F1 score of 0.74 and ROC-AUC of 0.853. Thalach \(maximum heart rate\), oldpeak and exang were the most influential features. The trained model was served through a Flask REST API that correctly classified a high-risk and a low-risk patient and rejected incomplete input with status code 400. Note: this run used a simulated dataset with the UCI attributes, so the numbers will differ on the real dataset.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
